  "description": "Nethereum.HdWallet uses BIP32 and BIP39 to generate an HD tree of Ethereum compatible addreses from a randomly generated word seeds. \n    This is compatible with keys generated using the standard (m/44'/60'/0'/0/x) usded in  BIP44, MetaMask, Jaxx, MyEtherWallet (default), TREZOR App, Exodus\n    or (m/44'/60'/0'/x) used in Electrum, MyEtherWallet (ledger), Ledger Chrome App, imToken",
